# Implementation Plan: Pre-Populated Multi-Framework Controls & Enriched ISO Knowledge Base

This plan documents the complete technical implementation to add pre-populated built-in controls for **SOC 2 Type II**, **NIST CSF 2.0**, **DPDP / GDPR**, **ISO 22301 BCMS**, **X-BOM / SBOM**, and an enriched **ISO 27001 Knowledge Base JSON dataset**, as well as fixing the UI framework dropdown filtering in `app.js`.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Built-in Controls Pre-Seeding**: Currently, only **ISO 27001** (93 controls) and **VAPT** (15 controls) have pre-seeded control dictionaries in `src/core/controls_data.py`. Frameworks shown in the UI dropdown (**SOC 2 Type II**, **DPDP/GDPR**, **ISO 22301**, **X-BOM**) currently fall back to showing ISO 27001 controls.
> - **New NIST CSF 2.0 Support**: We will add **NIST CSF 2.0** (22 Core Controls) to the framework dropdown and control dataset.
> - **Enriched ISO 27001 Sub-Question Knowledge Base**: We will add `src/core/iso27001_knowledge.json` containing auditor sub-questions for enhanced prompt reasoning.

